{#-
  A teaching email a question bank's coordinator wrote: the pass
  certificate to a student, or the note to the coordinator. The coordinator
  writes the words in the bank's config.yaml, as Markdown; Quill supplies
  the frame. Context:
    subject    the subject, with its variables already filled in
    preheader  the line an inbox shows after it
    body_html  the Markdown converted and sanitised with nh3, marked safe
               by the caller: this template does not escape it again
    body_text  the same body as plain text
    reason     why the recipient is getting it
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block subject %}{{ subject }}{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}{{ preheader }}{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
<div style="font-size: 19px">{{ body_html }}</div>
{% endblock %}
{% block reason %}{{ reason }}{% endblock %}
{% block text %}{{ body_text }}{% endblock %}
